WEBVTT

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:24.630
The costumes have arrived, right?

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:25.920
Where did you put the props?

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:27.290
Rehearsal will be starting soon!

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:31.960
Sorry to keep you!

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.830
I'm so glad I finished in time.

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:43.310
It was worth adding that 
extra level of detail!

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:53.540
Okay, I've still got other 
costumes to go over.

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:54.920
Do your best!

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:06.120
Grea...

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:16.210
Mysteria Friends

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:22.040
Backstage Confidential

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:45.750
Where's the prez?

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:48.250
She has her hands full
dealing with the stage performance.

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:50.750
Oh, the one that the princesses
are going to be part of?

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:55.420
Okay, everyone, one more time.
Put your heart into it.

00:01:55.790 --> 00:01:58.170
Start the music from the top!

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:02.460
This one is for you, Lou.

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:04.880
I made it extra special 
so that you stand out.

00:02:06.670 --> 00:02:08.250
Thank you.

00:02:12.790 --> 00:02:15.440
This isn't good. I'm super nervous.

00:02:18.920 --> 00:02:20.460
You look like a piece of fine art...

00:02:23.540 --> 00:02:24.460
What was that?

00:02:24.460 --> 00:02:27.330
Nothing, I was just saying
that dress looks great on you.

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:30.380
It's not weird... at all?

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:31.460
Not in the slightest.

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:37.460
I still think you're a better fit
for this role than me, Anne.

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:42.710
Oh jeez, you know everyone is excited to see you
all decked out as a proper princess, Grea.

00:02:42.710 --> 00:02:43.890
You've got this!

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:48.890
But I never wear frilly stuff like this,
so it's making me nervous.

00:02:48.890 --> 00:02:50.790
Everything is going to be fine.

00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:52.880
We've been practicing so hard!

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:56.330
My stomach... is starting to hurt.

00:02:58.830 --> 00:02:59.830
Where exactly?

00:02:59.830 --> 00:03:00.710
Anne...

00:03:00.710 --> 00:03:02.130
I'll heal you right away!

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:04.990
I-it's okay. I'm fine.

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:06.360
But...!

00:03:06.360 --> 00:03:08.330
It's not that big of a deal.

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:10.380
Are you sure?

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:12.660
Yeah, I'm all right.

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:15.250
If you feel any pain, let me know right away.

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:17.290
S-sure...

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:19.260
Sorry.

00:03:36.830 --> 00:03:38.500
We'll start from the opening scene.

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:41.990
Please make sure the timing of
the lights and music are in synch.

00:03:58.790 --> 00:04:00.790
Want to go over your lines one more time?

00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:05.880
I already did once before I went to bed last night
and again before I came today.

00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:07.080
Grea...

00:04:09.420 --> 00:04:11.770
I really hope I'm up for this...

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:15.020
All right!

00:04:23.460 --> 00:04:24.960
Breathe in.

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:28.830
And out.

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:30.580
Anne?

00:04:31.710 --> 00:04:34.540
You'll be okay. I'm here for you.

00:04:35.630 --> 00:04:37.080
Close your eyes.

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:43.920
Okay, let's float for a bit.

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:45.250
"Float"?

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:47.590
Imagine it, just imagine yourself floating.

00:05:22.290 --> 00:05:23.290
Huh?

00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:28.250
Anne?

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:29.330
Don't fidget.

00:05:31.710 --> 00:05:36.130
Relax your arms and legs, nice and easy.

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:40.270
Now open your eyes.

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:44.290
I beg you to look upon me!

00:05:44.290 --> 00:05:45.280
Huh?

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:48.780
There is nothing you need fear, my lady.

00:05:50.210 --> 00:05:51.500
Those are her lines...

00:05:52.380 --> 00:05:58.710
The voices of your earthly opponents
are not sounding in your fearful heart.

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:03.800
No, that is your own voice,
which lacks the faith to believe.

00:06:10.130 --> 00:06:14.290
Despair is a plague afflicting us.

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:18.850
Unable to do otherwise, I hesitate.

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:21.440
To take that one step...

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:24.940
I cannot do it without you!

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:26.820
Anne.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:31.320
My prince!

00:06:31.670 --> 00:06:33.710
There is nothing to fear.

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:36.830
You are truly the falcon of dawn.

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:41.330
You, my savior.

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:43.090
Princess.

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:45.830
Thank you.

00:06:47.710 --> 00:06:49.000
It's almost time.

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:51.330
Please get ready, you two.

00:06:52.080 --> 00:06:53.080
Grea!

00:06:57.000 --> 00:07:00.350
Princess, there is nothing to fear.

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:02.580
So long as we are together.

00:07:09.210 --> 00:07:11.920
Let us go together, my prince.

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:26.580
Whoa...

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:28.710
It's a full house.

00:07:33.460 --> 00:07:35.630
Do your best out there, Hanna.

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:38.500
Right.

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:49.290
Hanna's amazing.

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:52.670
And we're supposed to go next...?

00:09:52.670 --> 00:09:53.830
Yeah.

00:09:54.210 --> 00:09:56.630
My stomach is starting to hurt...

00:09:56.630 --> 00:09:57.660
Huh?

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:40.760
Episode 9
A Slice of Life

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:40.500
Mysteria Friends, episode 
9: "A Slice of Life."

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:45.750
llustration by: LM7

00:12:39.250 --> 00:12:41.000
Morning already, huh?

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:18.540
Today's the day of the performance...

00:13:19.290 --> 00:13:21.000
I'm so not ready.
